## Root cause

The connection pool size was reduced from 200 to 20 in a routine config change. Under normal traffic, 20 connections could not keep up, so requests waited in the pool queue until they hit their timeout. Nothing in the deploy path flagged a tenfold reduction in a capacity setting, and the cause took 27 minutes to identify after the first alert.

!! The config linter did not validate pool size bounds, so a value of 20 passed review and deployment unchallenged.

